#: manager.ts:282
msgid "Its current and previous versions are removed from the installed plugins. Its shortcut changes are kept and come back if you install it again."
msgstr "将从安装库移除它的当前版本与上一版本。它的快捷键修改会保留，重新安装后恢复。"

#: manager.ts:283
